### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Root
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### Create a task (replace token with your .env API_TOKEN)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/
Authorization: Bearer replace-this-with-your-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Week 6 project",
  "description": "Build and test the production-style API",
  "status": "in_progress",
  "priority": "high"
}

### List tasks with pagination
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/?limit=10&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer replace-this-with-your-token

### Filter tasks
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/?status=pending&priority=high&search=project
Authorization: Bearer replace-this-with-your-token

### Get one task (replace 1 with a real ID)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer replace-this-with-your-token

### Update a task
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer replace-this-with-your-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### Delete a task
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer replace-this-with-your-token
